---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Stránka nenalezena (404)" description="Hledaná stránka neexistuje.">
  <div class="not-found">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Chyba 404</p>
    <h1 class="not-found-title">Stránka nenalezena</h1>
    <p class="not-found-lede">
      Tato cesta v expozici neexistuje. Možná byla přesunuta, nebo nikdy nebyla.
    </p>

    <div class="not-found-clock" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" width="120" height="120">
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="90" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 6" />
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
        <line x1="100" y1="100" x2="100" y2="40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" transform="rotate(15 100 100)" />
        <line x1="100" y1="100" x2="140" y2="100" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" transform="rotate(-30 100 100)" />
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="4" fill="currentColor" />
        <text x="100" y="35" text-anchor="middle" font-family="serif" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">XII</text>
        <text x="165" y="105" text-anchor="middle" font-family="serif" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">III</text>
        <text x="100" y="175" text-anchor="middle" font-family="serif" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">VI</text>
        <text x="35" y="105" text-anchor="middle" font-family="serif" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">IX</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="not-found-options">
      <h2 class="text-xl mb-4" style="margin-top: 0;">Co můžeš zkusit</h2>
      <ul class="not-found-list">
        <li>
          <a href="/">Začít znovu na titulce</a>
          <span class="not-found-detail">— hero, statistiky, vybrané exponáty</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/atlas">Procházet Atlas</a>
          <span class="not-found-detail">— vizuální katalog 218 hodin</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/mapa">Mapa věží a expozic</a>
          <span class="not-found-detail">— 26 lokací v Česku a Evropě</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/sbirka">Sbírka</a>
          <span class="not-found-detail">— švarcvaldky, vodní, sluneční, květinové</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <button data-search-trigger class="not-found-search-btn">Vyhledat</button>
          <span class="not-found-detail">— Cmd/Ctrl+K nebo lupa v navu</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="not-found-foot">
      Pokud se sem dostáváš z externího odkazu, který by měl fungovat,
      <a href="mailto:info@orloj.eu?subject=Rozbitý odkaz na hodinarium.eu">napiš nám</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .not-found {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .not-found-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-brass-bright);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .not-found-lede {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .not-found-clock {
    color: var(--color-brass);
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    animation: clock-spin 60s linear infinite;
    transform-origin: center;
  }

  @keyframes clock-spin {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .not-found-clock { animation: none; }
  }

  .not-found-options {
    text-align: left;
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brass) 20%, transparent);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .not-found-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .not-found-list li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .not-found-list a {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-brass-bright);
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .not-found-list a:hover {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .not-found-detail {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .not-found-search-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-brass-bright);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .not-found-search-btn:hover {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .not-found-foot {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
